    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a simple peasant living in medieval times, working for your feudal lord. One day, you discover the recipe for brewing beer. This changes your life - improve your brewing skills, unlock new sales channels, and expand your product across growing territories. But be careful! The world that discovers beer will never be as peaceful as before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.poster.avif?t=1753440581\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.webm?t=1753440581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.mp4?t=1753440581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the simplest <strong>beer</strong> made from bread. Then unlock increasingly advanced <strong>brewing technologies</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, sell your beer hand-to-hand, then open <strong>sales points</strong> at markets and eventually establish your own <strong>tavern</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy premises and equipment. Hire assistants and <strong>automate</strong> production. Conquer new lands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019d be wrong to think the world won\u2019t change after learning about beer. Public order will be disrupted. You and everyone else must be more careful at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now!</strong></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a simple peasant living in medieval times, working for your feudal lord. One day, you discover the recipe for brewing beer. This changes your life - improve your brewing skills, unlock new sales channels, and expand your product across growing territories. But be careful! The world that discovers beer will never be as peaceful as before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Brew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.poster.avif?t=1753440581\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.webm?t=1753440581\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3737930/extras/974fec56e46e05be25e698693acb66ca.mp4?t=1753440581\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with the simplest <strong>beer</strong> made from bread. Then unlock increasingly advanced <strong>brewing technologies</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At first, sell your beer hand-to-hand, then open <strong>sales points</strong> at markets and eventually establish your own <strong>tavern</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expand</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy premises and equipment. Hire assistants and <strong>automate</strong> production. Conquer new lands.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019d be wrong to think the world won\u2019t change after learning about beer. Public order will be disrupted. You and everyone else must be more careful at night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now!</strong></h2>",
